    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Hands-on 爬蟲練習\n",
        "\n",
        "-   [Ptt Tech_Job 版](https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/Tech_Job/index.html)\n",
        "-   試著爬出所有**標題**\n",
        "-   爬出的第三個標題是？\n",
        "-   提示：\n",
        "    -   下載html `requests.get(網址)`\n",
        "    -   解析html `BeautifulSoup(下載網頁.text, \"html.parser\")`\\\n",
        "    -   搜尋所需節點 `find(節點)`, `select(css條件)`\n",
        "    -   取出需要的資料 `get_text()`, `get(屬性名稱)`\n",
        "\n",
        "## 即時股價爬取 - 取出需要的資料 -4\n",
        "\n",
        "-   `.get_text()`可抓取節點內文字\n",
        "-   `.get(\"屬性名稱\")`可抓取屬性內容\n"
      ],
      "id": "121821dc"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for title_click in news:\n",
        "  print(title_click.get(\"href\"))"
      ],
      "id": "5e057418",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 即時股價爬取 - 爬連結內的新聞\n",
        "\n",
        "-   得到連結後，重複上述步驟\n",
        "    -   下載html `requests.get(網址)`\n",
        "    -   解析html `BeautifulSoup(下載網頁.text, \"html.parser\")`\\\n",
        "    -   搜尋所需節點 `find(節點)`, `select(css條件)`\n",
        "    -   取出需要的資料 `get_text()`, `get(屬性名稱)`\n",
        "\n",
        "## 即時股價爬取 - 爬連結內的新聞\n",
        "\n",
        "首先取得連結list。\n",
        "\n",
        "補充內容：\n",
        "\n",
        "-   `sequence物件.append()`可新增內容至sequence中\n"
      ],
      "id": "054bb31e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "url_list = []\n",
        "title_list = []\n",
        "for title_click in news:\n",
        "  url_list.append(title_click.get(\"href\"))\n",
        "  title_list.append(title_click.get_text())\n",
        "print(url_list)"
      ],
      "id": "5b6641fa",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 即時股價爬取 - 爬連結內的新聞\n",
        "\n",
        "以第一個新聞連結為例，下載html後，重複步驟，取得本文\n"
      ],
      "id": "9b943f67"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "res = requests.get(url_list[0])\n",
        "soup = BeautifulSoup(res.text, \"html.parser\")\n",
        "news_full = soup.select_one(\".caas-body\")\n",
        "print(\"標題: \"+title_list[0] +\", 內文:\" + news_full.get_text())"
      ],
      "id": "2e1771e4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 即時股價爬取 - 爬連結內的新聞\n",
        "\n",
        "用`for`迴圈一次做完所有連結\n"
      ],
      "id": "ff7f766c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for title_click in news:\n",
        "  title = title_click.get_text()\n",
        "  url = title_click.get(\"href\")\n",
        "  res = requests.get(url)\n",
        "  soup = BeautifulSoup(res.text, \"html.parser\")\n",
        "  news_full = soup.select_one(\".caas-body\")\n",
        "  print(\"標題: \"+title +\", 內文:\" + news_full.get_text())"
      ],
      "id": "4f64a283",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 即時股價爬取 - 爬連結內的新聞\n",
        "\n",
        "用`for`迴圈一次做完所有連結，並轉成pandas data frame\n"
      ],
      "id": "10ff01c1"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "newdf = []\n",
        "for title_click in news:\n",
        "  title = title_click.get_text()\n",
        "  url = title_click.get(\"href\")\n",
        "  res = requests.get(url)\n",
        "  soup = BeautifulSoup(res.text, \"html.parser\")\n",
        "  news_full = soup.select_one(\".caas-body\")\n",
        "  add_news = pd.DataFrame({\"title\":[title],\"content\":[news_full.get_text()]})\n",
        "  newdf.append(add_news)\n",
        "\n",
        "newdf_pd=pd.concat(newdf)\n",
        "newdf_pd"
      ],
      "id": "2290b53c",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 即時股價爬取 - 爬連結內的新聞\n"
      ],
      "id": "a2d7dfc6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "newdf_pd"
      ],
      "id": "e8372005",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Hands-on 爬蟲練習\n",
        "\n",
        "-   [Ptt Tech_Job 版](https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/Tech_Job/index.html)\n",
        "-   試著爬出**最新的一頁**、**前一頁**以及**前前一頁**的所有**標題**和**內文網址**\n",
        "-   總共爬出幾個標題？\n",
        "-   提示：\n",
        "    -   下載html `requests.get(網址)`\n",
        "    -   解析html `BeautifulSoup(下載網頁.text, \"html.parser\")`\\\n",
        "    -   搜尋所需節點 `find(節點)`, `select(css條件)`\n",
        "    -   取出需要的資料 `get_text()`, `get(屬性名稱)`\n",
        "-   一頁一頁爬 or for 迴圈都可以\n",
        "\n",
        "## 網頁爬蟲 進階版\n",
        "\n",
        "-   滾動式等動態網頁網頁，如剛剛的新聞\n",
        "    -   [Python 進階爬蟲 by Andy Chiang](https://hackmd.io/@AndyChiang/DynamicCrawler)\n",
        "\n",
        "## 網頁爬蟲 再想想？\n",
        "\n",
        "-   其實... 很多資料有其他存取方式，像API\n",
        "-   隱私問題 （OkCupid事件）\n",
        "    -   [70,000 OkCupid Users Just Had Their Data Published](https://motherboard.vice.com/en_us/article/70000-okcupid-users-just-had-their-data-published)\n",
        "\n",
        "## 網頁爬蟲 Webscraping - Recap\n",
        "\n",
        "-   下載html `requests.get(網址)`\n",
        "-   解析html `BeautifulSoup(下載網頁.text, \"html.parser\")`\n",
        "-   搜尋所需節點 `find(節點)`, `select(css條件)`\n",
        "-   取出需要的資料 `get_text()`, `get(屬性名稱)`\n",
        "\n",
        "# 資料匯出\n",
        "\n",
        "## 資料匯出\n",
        "\n",
        "-   文字檔 .txt\n",
        "-   CSV檔 .csv\n",
        "-   json檔 .json\n",
        "\n",
        "## 資料匯出 - 文字檔 .txt\n",
        "\n",
        "-   首先使用`open(檔案名稱)`開啟檔案\n",
        "-   使用`檔案.writelines(資料)`寫入內容\n",
        "-   `檔案.writelines(資料)`的資料可以是列表\n"
      ],
      "id": "32f2a115"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "path = 'output_writeline.txt'\n",
        "f = open(path, 'w')\n",
        "lines1 = ['Hello World', '123', '456', '789']\n",
        "lines2 = ['Hello World\\n', '123\\n', '456\\n', '789\\n']\n",
        "f.writelines(lines1)\n",
        "f.writelines(lines2)\n",
        "f.close()"
      ],
      "id": "4653c0f5",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 資料匯出 - 文字檔 .txt\n",
        "\n",
        "-   首先使用`open(檔案名稱)`開啟檔案\n",
        "-   使用`檔案.write(資料)`寫入內容\n",
        "-   `檔案.write(資料)`的資料必須是文字\n"
      ],
      "id": "fdc35fcd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "path = 'output_write.txt'\n",
        "f = open(path, 'w')\n",
        "for t in lines1:\n",
        "  f.write(t)\n",
        "  \n",
        "for t in lines2:\n",
        "  f.write(t)\n",
        "\n",
        "f.close()"
      ],
      "id": "f79c935c",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 資料匯出 - CSV檔 .csv\n",
        "\n",
        "使用`pandas` Data frame物件中的`.to_csv(檔名)`儲存檔案。\n"
      ],
      "id": "f8dd109a"
